# Local and Staging Environment Variables

## Shared

- `FREELINK_DB_URL`
- `FREELINK_DB_USER`
- `FREELINK_DB_PASSWORD`
- `FREELINK_REDIS_URL`
- `FREELINK_S3_ENDPOINT`
- `FREELINK_S3_ACCESS_KEY`
- `FREELINK_S3_SECRET_KEY`
- `FREELINK_JWT_SECRET`

## Staging defaults

- API: `https://staging-api.freelink.local`
- WS: `wss://staging-ws.freelink.local`
